# Build artifacts
dist
build
*.egg-info

# Rust build output. libs/cleargbm_rs/target alone is ~3.5GB and was being
# transferred into the build context on every docker build.
#
# The pattern MUST be `**/target`, not `target`. .dockerignore patterns are
# anchored at the context root, so a bare `target` matches only `./target` and
# never `./libs/cleargbm_rs/target` -- which is the only `target` this repo
# actually has. Measured 2026-08-16 with the bare pattern in place: 3.5GB of
# Rust build output was reaching every service's builder stage, and for
# Model-Trainer it was then baked into a `COPY --from=builder` layer that
# survived the later `rm -rf`. Same anchoring rule applies to node_modules.
**/target

# Node
**/node_modules

# Rust coverage artifacts (~32MB in libs/cleargbm_rs, regenerated by CI).
**/coverage.json
**/cov_report.json
**/cov_histogram.lcov

